data openbmc_fan_typed_operation_note: String = "OpenBMC fan observation and mutation are a composition of typed argv and typed file-transfer operations. ObjectMapper and sensor values are requested from busctl as JSON and projected through typed local jq operations; no consumer parses busctl's presentation text. The jq programs are confined to this extdeps realizer as fixed semantic projections; gunbc intent never constructs shell syntax. Password material remains on sshpass fd 0. The caller separately models which file-publication operations establish a durability commit barrier."
